      "id": 4338013,
      "name": "[Weak] Specialized Blade of the Other: Block",
      "desc": "When equipped, this item grants three Alter Skills: Perfect Block, Phase Dash, and Powerful Slash.\n\n[Perfect Block Enhancement]\nEnhancement I: When Powerful Slash hits a normal/elite/boss enemy, it reduces squad Corruption by <color=#2BAD00>10%/30%/60%</color> and restores <color=#2BAD00>2.5%/3.5%/5%</color> HP to all squad members, respectively.\n\nEnhancement II: Perfect Block triggers a Dodge even if the block fails.\n\nAgainst enemies at <color=#CF4029>Lv. 60 or higher</color>, <color=#CF4029>Powerslash</color> deals <color=#CF4029>50%</color> less DMG.",
